==Battleground==
*2 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 200 seconds<sup>6,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ancient Magamojoe]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn, delay 50~53.33 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,600f</sup>.
**3 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**4 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 50~53.33 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,600f</sup>.
**1 [[Fallen Bear]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Chickful A]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
**4 [[Mooth]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
**1 [[Ackey]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 56.67~60 seconds<sup>1,700f~1,800f</sup>.
**3 [[Fallen Bear]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 56.67~60 seconds<sup>1,700f~1,800f</sup>.
**2 [[Ackey]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 56.67~60 seconds<sup>1,700f~1,800f</sup>.
**3 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 50~53.33 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,600f</sup>.
**3 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 113.33 seconds<sup>3,400f</sup>, delay 50~53.33 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Stall the starting enemies and then kill them with the cannon after they kill your meatshields to easily max out your wallet. [[Esoteric Uril]] is a very good pick for this stage if you happen to have him. Bring units that are either surge immune or outrange the surges because they do a lot of damage. [[Brainwashed Mohawk Cat]] is a very good meatshield for this stage with his ability to dodge Relic and Aku.

